/target
test-bin

# `/debug/` is anchored, unlike the unanchored `debug/` this used to be in
# variegated-comms-rs. Unanchored it matched *any* directory named `debug` at any
# depth, which silently excluded `variegated-comms-firmware/src/debug/` -- a source
# module -- from every commit, with no error and nothing in `git status` to notice.
# Cargo's own debug output lives at `target/debug`, which the line above already
# covers; this entry is only for the pre-2018 layout that put it at the root.
/debug/

# Editor configuration
.vscode/
.zed/
.helix/
.nvim.lua

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb
